 <h3><u>Jula to nazar ayenga</u></h3> 
 <div style=width:100%> 
  <p><b><u><font size=4></font></u></b></p>
  <p><b><u><font size=4>Jula to nazar ayenga</font></u></b></p>
  <b><u><font size=4> </font></u></b>
  <p><font size=4>Jula na julawo are rona hai muqaddar ab ayenga na wo, julne walaa, Aay madar-e-asgar</font></p>
  <font size=4> <p>(Na milengaa na milengaa) x2</p> <p>(Jula to nazar ayenga, Asghar na milengaa) x2</p> 
   <ol>
    <li>Ab saari khudayi mei Asghar naa milenga </li>
    <p>(Jula to nazar ayenga, Asghar na milengaa) x2</p>
    <li>Ab julaa julaane ko taras jayengi bahe(n), Khayme mei kabhi dasht me dhundengi nigahe </li>
    <p>(Thak jayengi ye ankhe) X2 Asghar na milengaa </p>
    <p>(Jula to nazar ayenga, Asghar na milengaa) x2</p>
    <li>Ye soch ke rotaa hai mera dil bhi tarap kar, us waqt tere qalb pe kiyaa guzrengi muztar</li>
    <p>(Jab raato(n) ko pehlu mei) x2 Asghar naa milengaa</p>
    <p>(Jula to nazar ayenga, Asghar na milengaa) x2</p>
    <li>Kya waqt-e-musibat hai Zaraa dekh ay dukhiyaa, kal jhule mei beshir tha aur pani nahi tha</li>
    <p>(Mil jayengaa jab pani) x2 (Asghar na milengaa)x2</p>
    <p>(Jula to nazar ayenga, Asghar na milengaa) x2</p>
    <li>Saaye me na jawungi tu ghar lawt ke ajaa, har waqt tere hoto(n) per hongaa yahi noha</li>
    <p>(Bin tere suku(n) maa ko) x2 Asghar na milengaa</p>
    <p>(Jula to nazar ayenga, Asghar na milengaa) x2</p>
    <li>Dhayenge layee(n) ham per abhi aur qayamat, dhundenge shaki dasht me beshir ki turbat </li>
    <p>(Shuhadaa ke saro me jab) x2 Asghar na milengaa </p>
    <p>(Jula to nazar ayenga, Asghar na milengaa) x2</p>
    <li>Are bin pani ke dunya se sidhra mera Asghar, jab ayenga pani to meri pyaarisi dukhtar</li>
    <p>(Dhundengi use ban me) x2 Asghar na milengaa</p>
    <p>(Jula to nazar ayenga, Asghar na milengaa) x2</p>
    <li>Zinda(n) se riha ho ker jab jawonge tum ghar, har god me dhundengi bohat royengi muztar</li>
    <p>(Jab fatema sughra ko) x2 Asghar na milengaa </p>
    <p>(Jula to nazar ayenga, Asghar na milengaa) x2</p>
    <li>Hatho me uthawongi jab pani ka kuza, pani me nazar ayengaa besheer kaa chehra</li>
    <p>(Bas aas nazar ayengaa) x2 Asghar naa milengaa</p>
    <p>(Jula to nazar ayenga, Asghar na milengaa) x2</p>
    <li>Yaad ayenga reh reh kar jo Asghar ka huwakla, aur shok shahadat me wo jhule me machal na</li>
    <p>(Tum dil ko mana lena) x2 Asghar na milengaa </p>
    <p>(Jula to nazar ayenga, Asghar na milengaa) x2</p>
    <li>Asghar ke shaluke jab nazar ayenge ghar me, ik dard se us waqt bhi uthenga jigar me </li>
    <p>(Sab honge waha leykin) x2 Asghar na milengaa </p>
    <p>(Jula to nazar ayenga, Asghar na milengaa) x2</p>
    <li>Ab saari khudayi mei Asghar naa milenga </li>
   </ol> 
